    "type": "post",
    "title": "EOW: Nomatic Caravan",
    "text": "This project was A LOT of fun. This was done for Conceptart.orgs Enviornment of the week contest thing. \n\nThe outline is: A Caravan of Nomadic Peoples. These folks Homes are in their vehicles, and the culture is based on being forever transient. You are to portray the entire community and how their transient lifestyel is reflected in their vehicles and mode of travel. this can be anything from a MIddle eastern camel and tent caravan, mongols, Gypsies, modern gypsies, space gypsies. I want to see the caravan, and where it is traveling. as well as the culture of the people.\n\nI decided to go with an Aztec culture. At first i thought this would be something I could just go in and do but in the end I did a lot of research and it was great. I mean look at the final im so proud!!!!",
    "url": "https://www.deviantart.com/ravenseyetravislacey/art/EOW%3A-Nomatic-Caravan-144571693",
    "published_at": "2009-11-23T23:33:28.000Z",
    "fetched_at": "2026-11-25T20:23:05.222Z"
  },
